# Local session notes — do not commit

`progress.md` and `Handoff.md` at the repo root are **local agent handoff notes**.

## Rules

- Write or update them when the user asks for progress / handoff docs.
- **Never** `git add` or commit `progress.md` or `Handoff.md`.
- Keep both listed in `.gitignore` under “Local agent session notes”.
- If they show up as untracked, fix `.gitignore` instead of staging them.
- Do not move their content into README or other tracked docs unless the user explicitly asks.
